  unitName: GS-220
  unitId: 50291
  unitNumber: 637
  description: A guardian weapon that can move autonomously which can be found in
    ancient ruins. It is believed that perhaps it came from another world, but there
    are a considerable number of these still active all over Grand Gaia. Now they
    inhabit populated areas, making it seem like they were meant to protect the humans
    around them. However, it seems like their contents have been scrambled somehow
    and thus have been reduced to nothing but weapons that attack any type of moving
    object. One should be careful when approaching their mysterious and round bodies.
